{"title":"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2.5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2.5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/259d1d91a5687fe90489d9efeeab80c4de05cf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> is a rectangle with diagonals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da1bd2309dd6ebab80a9ada0c1cd7568ff5a30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" />, as shown.\nThe value of y is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7ef24cd2f986ea281aa44947b3cbe0d2ea4e4cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 40 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 45 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2013CEMCGauss8P17diagram.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/3/39/2013CEMCGauss8P17diagram.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"174\" height=\"174\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> \n</p><p>~diagram uploaded by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:grogg007\">grogg007</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The interior angles of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangle</a> are all <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_angle\" title=\"Right angle\">right angles</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Acute_angle\" title=\"Acute angle\">acute angles</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, we have the following equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17183155d338842280f5881d6e8cb9f7ec4e378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x^{\\circ} + 4x^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa6d6df6cb1145493f3bc2f636a7137225a2162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{\\circ} + y^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Solving the first equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cdee812c8fd12fda2cae491a6546966dd94c4fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce07f44aade9496a90bf9ffa973f2152fcee4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> into the second equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/241fab238dfaf935ac996ac387c3fec83b6f99ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 10^{\\circ} + y^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd9b1afd74a3aef1fed1cb87f5072faf7cf9b060.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40^{\\circ} + y^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c901d030e61c546134478780635db6353e1ddaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"101\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the above process to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and then notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e9f9eb8f39820b3b8cd2c4b06e10d90e0d3b44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> would be alternate interior angles. Thus,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2404e58521aa22d961afaece1bfa0be59773b9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5x = 5 \\times 10 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"218\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2.5\">Solution 2.5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2.5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can also get to the conclusion that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e7d1b66bb47699c9d67ef1c99aae2244343a84f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> by using the equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe8809887cb0e259c636cc3c19479820b2b165f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x = 90 - 5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/2/ce2c1f5687d01c15d6bf50988a20bbc44985998a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x + y = 90 - 5x + y = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"211\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/4/a44c78ad4d5bb37fdb0e4a383f859652be976d02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 90 - 90 + 5x = 5x = 5 \\times 10 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"343\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1