w\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.169 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 199/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2333/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 593/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4170/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.093      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    8.093      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32018:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232601 and revision id 263498. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}